# The last round's rival is restarted by the Watchdog (game/rounds.h, ROUND_RESTARTS). Film it with
# tests\e2e\film_round.ps1 -Round 5 -Steps restart.steps. Down into play as layouts.steps, then B
# (debug: the rival's terminated): "Enemy process eliminated", and a second and a half later it's
# back: "Watchdog: process restarted", its marker on the radar again. Twice
wait_boot
start_intro
press b
wait 5.5
press left
wait 0.6
press left
wait 0.6
press left
wait 4.0
shot restart_0_riding
press b
wait 0.7
shot restart_1_eliminated
wait 1.2
shot restart_2_restarted
wait 1.0
shot restart_3_riding
press b
wait 0.7
shot restart_4_eliminated_again
wait 1.3
shot restart_5_restarted_again
